/questions/assets/diagrams/q7c.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-1.18/questions/assets/diagrams/q7d.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\frac1{(x+3)^2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\frac1{x^2}-4\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\frac1{(x+2)^2}-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\frac1{(x-3)^2}+\\frac34\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.18-q8","number":8,"question":"<p>State the equations of the asymptotes of the curve <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\frac1{(x+5)^2}-2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-5\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=-2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.18-q9","number":9,"question":"<p>Sketch the following graphs, identifying where they intersect the coordinate axes and the equations of any asymptotes:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\frac1{x^2}+2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\frac1{(x-1)^2}-4\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\frac4{(x-4)^2}+9\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=4-\\frac1{x^2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=9-\\frac1{(x+2)^2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h